OL,3,GNEWSAFour-vehicle crash shuts A10      
OL,5,FA four-vehicle crash has shut part of  
OL,6,Fthe A10 near Waterbeach in             
OL,7,FCambridgeshire.                        
OL,9,FPolice were called at 06:25 GMT to     
OL,10,Freports of a collision and the road has
OL,11,Fbeen closed in both directions between 
OL,12,FWaterbeach and Chittering.             
OL,14,FFour people have been treated at the   
OL,15,Fscene and one person suffered serious  
OL,16,Fbut not life-threatening injuries,     
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Police said.            
OL,19,FEmergency services are at the scene and
OL,20,Fdrivers have been advised to avoid the 
OL,21,Farea for several hours.                
